<h1>Standard Library Reference</h1>
<p>The toke standard library provides 35 modules covering HTTP, data, AI, cryptography, media, and more. All modules are imported with <code>i=alias:std.module;</code> syntax.</p>

<h2>Core</h2>
<div class="ref-grid">
  <a href="/docs/reference/str" class="ref-card"><strong>str</strong><span>String operations</span></a>
  <a href="/docs/reference/http" class="ref-card"><strong>http</strong><span>HTTP client and server</span></a>
  <a href="/docs/reference/json" class="ref-card"><strong>json</strong><span>JSON parse and generate</span></a>
  <a href="/docs/reference/log" class="ref-card"><strong>log</strong><span>Structured logging</span></a>
  <a href="/docs/reference/env" class="ref-card"><strong>env</strong><span>Environment variables</span></a>
  <a href="/docs/reference/file" class="ref-card"><strong>file</strong><span>File system I/O</span></a>
</div>

